        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Moodboard Frame from a Theme\n\nGenerates one square moodboard image from a written art direction. Run it several times and keep the frames that fit.\n\n**How it works:** \"Prompt\" holds the direction: muted earth palette, soft north light, matte finish and negative space. \"Generate\" turns it into a 1:1 image at 1K resolution, and \"Image\" shows the frame.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"Generate\", then rewrite \"Prompt\" for your own theme, such as \"high-contrast street photography, neon reflections, wet asphalt\"."
